# Cloudflare Pages redirects (ignored by GitHub Pages, which gets the
# meta-refresh page Astro's `redirects` config emits instead).

# Google Search Console verification.
#
# Cloudflare Pages strips .html extensions: it 308s /file.html to /file and
# serves the content there. Google fetches the exact URL it issued, ending
# .html, so the token was reachable only through a redirect. The 200 below is
# a rewrite rather than a redirect — same content, served under the URL Google
# asks for, no hop in between.
#
# Do not remove either this line or public/google86e87b3d4788a10e.html.
# Removing them un-verifies the property and loses its history.
/google86e87b3d4788a10e.html   /google86e87b3d4788a10e   200
#
# /free-review was a second enquiry route competing with /contact for the same
# conversion. Its content now lives on /contact in full. A meta-refresh is all
# a static build can emit; this makes it a real 301 so link equity and any
# indexed result move properly.
/free-review     /contact/     301
/free-review/    /contact/     301
